    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/fa9bb7d70a704b0a6158c8fa959ad214.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Each of the 4 classes in the game maintain a rock-paper-scissors style relationship with each other:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/883ef0bcb9397dd244955fd2b9fde3dd.poster.avif?t=1712653594\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/883ef0bcb9397dd244955fd2b9fde3dd.webm?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/883ef0bcb9397dd244955fd2b9fde3dd.mp4?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/83334179a2f3c22f662a1e01841a5886.poster.avif?t=1712653594\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/83334179a2f3c22f662a1e01841a5886.webm?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/83334179a2f3c22f662a1e01841a5886.mp4?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/432bbc75458e201a7f84e564dc7dd94d.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Bring a team of 4 units, of any class and combination into each mission!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/40938efb5d971db64ce081dcba70ec44.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/8664f2abb8165a8572c96298f4271017.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>The HUD allows players to quickly see how terrain and cover is affecting them in battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/7ba2137f631a92d8e858b57bb7e76b87.poster.avif?t=1712653594\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/7ba2137f631a92d8e858b57bb7e76b87.webm?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/7ba2137f631a92d8e858b57bb7e76b87.mp4?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/26089cbdb6c02c5a0beb336ded935523.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Vertical Fighters features different ways of customising your units to better fit your playstyle!<br>Each customisation option changes your <strong><i>&quot;Power&quot;</i></strong>:<br><br>1. The greater the bonus offered, the more <strong><i>Power</i></strong> will be added to your unit's total.<br>2.  A unit with lower Power will have a shorter recovery time compared to a higher <i><strong>Power</strong></i> unit.<br>3.  If your enemies kill you, they are awarded the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> of your unit in the form of points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/df08874dc2ae837800ff4997f4945c3c.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/ea01872a46439f62ea836b1a174bd071.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/c6e9a1ad294990f97aa63eac7c1378c0.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Take control of 4 distinct classes of units and engage in inter-layer combat in the air and on the ground. And yes, as huge nod to arcade SCHMUPS you can even play as a stationary turret and still be a killer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/bf9ab12477b0fd45dcb103e8a9daac31.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/52f66490995a1002ef44c374ef9dda12.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Many units come with variants in <strong>(A)</strong>ttack, <strong>(U)</strong>tility or <strong>(D)</strong>efense specialities. Each variant has an increased number of abilities over their standard form. Each new ability increases the unit\u2019s <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating. The examples below are of the Helicopter Gunship:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/3ff32d0267e083cdf7fa7f0086e3c9ba.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/9ea981ce61f2fafcda217882fdf8d358.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Equip a variety of different Camouflage to adjust the way you play! Each one offers its own set of bonuses. Below are some examples of camouflages in matching terrain.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/24c81dd2acd3035b211dd375db4b6d3e.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4f25776b1eb919002e23043695ad0509.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Pilots offer a way to change the many stats of your units, directly affecting their handling and performance. The more powerful the bonus stat, the higher the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating. There are even some pilots that offer negative modifiers, allowing a shrewd player to lower their Power rating (and recovery time) in return!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/ccc4821af6e127475daf1e942a39bb60.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/101dd0e1b56bbf2fe9a8404d210ad545.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br>If you play as a weaker unit, you have a lower <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating but you are also 'worth' less points when killed! Conversely, playing as a more powerful unit makes you 'worth' more to your enemies!<br><br>This allows a player to flex the Underdog fantasy if they have the skills, and still be rewarded for it. Or simply feel like a miniboss in the spirit of classic shoot-em-ups!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4d6fd4003e9057ffcc58fd21864851cd.poster.avif?t=1712653594\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4d6fd4003e9057ffcc58fd21864851cd.webm?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4d6fd4003e9057ffcc58fd21864851cd.mp4?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/ec7f6c2765879a9b0703de9ad2091e15.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Assemble and colour your own personalised emblem! Give your opponents something to remember you by.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/5299a5f103c625bbb6ef68a4ccf444e3.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/2894c5db5ac6c1912f0c3c6f76c77a3c.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Join up to 3 other human players, as you tackle missions co-op or go head-to-head in deathmatch with up to 8 AI bots!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/2119721f09a13fbeb13ff9726fbbb974.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/3b132fe1ac9937d65652a3c6817b67b0.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Always have a shot at first place! Look forward to seeing your callsign on the leaderboards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/5b0606ee072aba539065a2ecaa894152.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span>",
