2437930/extras/24c81dd2acd3035b211dd375db4b6d3e.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4f25776b1eb919002e23043695ad0509.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Pilots offer a way to change the many stats of your units, directly affecting their handling and performance. The more powerful the bonus stat, the higher the <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating. There are even some pilots that offer negative modifiers, allowing a shrewd player to lower their Power rating (and recovery time) in return!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/ccc4821af6e127475daf1e942a39bb60.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/101dd0e1b56bbf2fe9a8404d210ad545.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br>If you play as a weaker unit, you have a lower <strong><i>Power</i></strong> rating but you are also 'worth' less points when killed! Conversely, playing as a more powerful unit makes you 'worth' more to your enemies!<br><br>This allows a player to flex the Underdog fantasy if they have the skills, and still be rewarded for it. Or simply feel like a miniboss in the spirit of classic shoot-em-ups!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4d6fd4003e9057ffcc58fd21864851cd.poster.avif?t=1712653594\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4d6fd4003e9057ffcc58fd21864851cd.webm?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/4d6fd4003e9057ffcc58fd21864851cd.mp4?t=1712653594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/ec7f6c2765879a9b0703de9ad2091e15.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Assemble and colour your own personalised emblem! Give your opponents something to remember you by.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/5299a5f103c625bbb6ef68a4ccf444e3.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/2894c5db5ac6c1912f0c3c6f76c77a3c.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Join up to 3 other human players, as you tackle missions co-op or go head-to-head in deathmatch with up to 8 AI bots!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/2119721f09a13fbeb13ff9726fbbb974.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/3b132fe1ac9937d65652a3c6817b67b0.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span><br>Always have a shot at first place! Look forward to seeing your callsign on the leaderboards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437930/extras/5b0606ee072aba539065a2ecaa894152.avif?t=1712653594\" /></span>",
